            <ArticleTitle>Painful dysphagia in a case of mediastinal tuberculous lymphadenopathy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>427-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A patient with mediastinal tuberculous lymphadenopathy is described. Presentation was with rapid onset of painful dysphagia following trauma to the neck. Early diagnosis was achieved by mediastinoscopy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
